{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmapviewdelegate\/mapview:annotationcanshowcallout:"]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"- (","kind":"text"},{"text":"BOOL","preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@BOOL","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"mapView:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"MLNMapView","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)MLNMapView","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"mapView","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"annotationCanShowCallout:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"id<MLNAnnotation>","preciseIdentifier":"c:Qoobjc(pl)MLNAnnotation","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"annotation","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"languages":["occ"],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"mapView","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The map view that has selected the annotation.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"annotation","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The object representing the annotation.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"text":"Return Value","level":2,"anchor":"return-value","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A Boolean value indicating whether the annotation should show a"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"callout.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This method is called after an annotation is selected, before any callout is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"displayed for the annotation."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the return value is "},{"code":"YES","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", a callout view is shown when the user taps on an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"annotation, selecting it. The default callout displays the annotation’s title"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and subtitle. You can add accessory views to either end of the callout by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"implementing the "},{"code":"-mapView:leftCalloutAccessoryViewForAnnotation:","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"-mapView:rightCalloutAccessoryViewForAnnotation:","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" methods. You can further"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"customize the callout’s contents by implementing the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"-mapView:calloutViewForAnnotation:","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" method."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If the return value is ","type":"text"},{"code":"NO","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", or if this method is absent from the delegate, or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"if the annotation lacks a title, the annotation will not show a callout even"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"when selected.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Related examples","level":4,"anchor":"Related-examples","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"TODO: Add annotation views and images"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"TODO: Display custom views as callouts","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"TODO: Default callout usage, learn how to show callouts for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotation","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" objects.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapViewDelegate\/mapView:annotationCanShowCallout:"},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Returns a Boolean value indicating whether the annotation is able to display","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"extra information in a callout bubble.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapViewDelegate"]]},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"mapView:annotationCanShowCallout:","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"mapView:annotationCanShowCallout:","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"mapView:annotationCanShowCallout:","externalID":"c:objc(pl)MLNMapViewDelegate(im)mapView:annotationCanShowCallout:","symbolKind":"method","roleHeading":"Instance Method","remoteSource":{"fileName":"MLNMapViewDelegate.h","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-native\/blob\/main\/platform\/ios\/src\/MLNMapViewDelegate.h#L880"}},"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNMapViewDelegate/mapView:annotationCanShowCallout:":{"fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"text":"mapView:annotationCanShowCallout:","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmapviewdelegate\/mapview:annotationcanshowcallout:","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapViewDelegate\/mapView:annotationCanShowCallout:","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"mapView:annotationCanShowCallout:","abstract":[{"text":"Returns a Boolean value indicating whether the annotation is able to display","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"extra information in a callout bubble.","type":"text"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNMapView":{"fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNMapView"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmapview","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"MLNMapView","abstract":[{"text":"An interactive, customizable map view with an interface similar to the one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"provided by Apple’s MapKit.","type":"text"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNMapViewDelegate":{"fragments":[{"text":"MLNMapViewDelegate","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmapviewdelegate","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapViewDelegate","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"MLNMapViewDelegate","abstract":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapViewDelegate"},{"text":" protocol defines a set of optional methods that you","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can use to receive map-related update messages. Because many map operations","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"require the ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView"},{"text":" class to load data asynchronously, the map view calls","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"these methods to notify your application when specific operations complete. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"map view also uses these methods to request information about annotations","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"displayed on the map, such as the styles and interaction modes to apply to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"individual annotations.","type":"text"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"abstract":[{"text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full control over data sources and styling.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","title":"MapLibre","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNAnnotation":{"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"MLNAnnotation","abstract":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotation","isActive":true},{"text":" protocol is used to provide annotation-related information","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to a map view. To use this protocol, you adopt it in any custom objects that"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"store or represent annotation data. Each object then serves as the source of"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"information about a single map annotation and provides critical information,","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"such as the annotation’s location on the map. Annotation objects do not provide"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the visual representation of the annotation but typically coordinate (in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"conjunction with the map view’s delegate) the creation of an appropriate"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"objects to handle the display.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotation","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnannotation","fragments":[{"text":"MLNAnnotation","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol"}}}